  "question": {
    "text": "The vapour of Hg absorb some electrons accelerated by a potential difference of 4.5 volts from rest as a result of which light is emitted. If the full energy of a single incident electron is supposed to be converted into light emitted by electron in a single Hg atom, find the wave number <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> of the light",
